# CQ38 (cross-module)
# Which targeted asset was ultimately impacted by a given threat actor's campaign?

PREFIX attack: <https://attack.mitre.org/>
PREFIX rdf:    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd:    <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

SELECT ?asset WHERE {
  attack:Akira attack:orchestrates ?campaign .
  ?campaign attack:causes_impact ?impact .
  ?impact attack:impacts_asset ?asset .
}
